title = "The Quarrelling Furies"

[Overview]
<background=nsstart">
<h2> The Quarreling Furies</h2>
<p>
The Furies have been quarreling over who has the best priest.  They have devised a tournament to find out.  They decided to practice on you mortals.  This is the Beginning of the End.</p>

